3170.\n```.\n\n**Step 8: Ten-millions place**.\n9 + 0 (carried over) = 9.\nWrite down 9.\n\n```.\n  924581297.\n+  671789441.\n----------------.\n  9983170.\n```.\n\n**Step 9: Hundred-millions place**.\n0 (no carry from previous step) + 0 (no carry from previous step) = 0.\nWrite down 0.\n\n```.\n  924581297.\n+  671789441.\n----------------.\n  9983170.\n```.\n\n**Step 10: Billion place**.\n0 (no carry from previous step) + 0 (no carry from previous step) = 0.\nWrite down 0.\n\n```.\n  924581297.\n+  671789441.\n----------------.\n  9983170.\n```. Therefore, my final answer is: "]]
